<body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:850px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;line-height:1.7;color:#222">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: 14 October 2026</p>
  <p>SA News Hub ("we", "us", "our") operates sa-news-hub.pages.dev. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your choices.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p><strong>a) Information you provide:</strong> If you contact us or send a news tip by email, we may collect your name, email address, and any information you include in your message.</p>
  <p><strong>b) Automatic information:</strong> When you visit our site, we may automatically collect your IP address, browser type, device type, pages visited, and time spent on pages, through analytics tools.</p>

  <h2>2. Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use cookies to make our site work, to understand traffic, and to show relevant advertising. You can control cookies in your browser settings. Third-party services, including Google Analytics and Google AdSense, may also use cookies.</p>

  <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To operate and improve our website</li>
    <li>To respond to your messages and news tips</li>
    <li>To understand which stories our readers value</li>
    <li>To show advertising and measure its performance</li>
    <li>To protect our site from abuse and spam</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Sharing Information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share anonymised analytics data with service providers like Google Analytics and Google AdSense. We may disclose information if required by South African law.</p>

  <h2>5. Third-Party Links</h2>
  <p>Our articles may link to other websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.</p>

  <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>Under POPIA (Protection of Personal Information Act) in South Africa, you have the right to request access to, correction, or deletion of your personal information. Contact us to make a request.</p>

  <h2>8. Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.</p>

  <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this policy, contact us at <strong>info@sa-news-hub.pages.dev</strong> or via our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>.</p>

